{"pageid": 273, "title": "Season 1", "revid": 2977, "categories": ["Seasons"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Season 1</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episodes\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episodes</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">TBA</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">TBA</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premiere\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premiere</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">TBA</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"finale\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Finale</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">TBA</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Season 1</b> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> original supernatural drama <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(TV_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (TV series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> was put into development on July 9, 2021.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-development&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-development-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cast\">Cast</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main\">Main</span></h3>\n<ul><li>TBA as <span class=\"new\" title=\"Erica Slaughter (TV series) (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRXJpY2FfU2xhdWdodGVyXyhUVl9zZXJpZXMpP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Erica Slaughter</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episodes\">Episodes</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Production\">Production</span></h2>\n<ul><li>On July 9, 2021, <a href=\"/wiki/Netflix\" title=\"Netflix\">Netflix</a> put <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(TV_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (TV series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> into development.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-development&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-development-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n<ul><li>Trevor Macy and Mike Flanagan were initially set to co-write and executive produce the series. However, creative differences led to the project being temporarily shelved and Netflix parting ways with the duo.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-development&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-development-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>On February 23, 2023, Netflix announced that <i><a href=\"https://dark-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/Dark\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:dark-netflix:Dark\">Dark</a></i> and <i><a href=\"https://1899-netflix.fandom.com/wiki/1899_(TV_series)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:1899-netflix:1899 (TV series)\">1899</a></i> creators <a href=\"/wiki/Baran_bo_Odar\" title=\"Baran bo Odar\">Baran bo Odar</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jantje_Friese\" title=\"Jantje Friese\">Jantje Friese</a> had been tapped to lead the series.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul></li>\n<li>On July 23, 2026, during a signing and Q&amp;A on Trinity Comics’ Whatnot stream, <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> revealed that there is a completed screenplay for the <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(film)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (film)\">live-action film</a>, but the delay is due to the companion animated series] The creative team wants to complete the \"series bible\" for the animated series before taking both adaptations out to studios and streamers simultaneously in hopes of finding a partner interested in both projects, though Tynion noted that if a buyer only wants the live-action film, the animated series can still be shopped elsewhere.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Promotional_images\">Promotional images</span></h3>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span></h3>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-development-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-development_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-development_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-development_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/movies/movie-news/doctor-sleep-filmmakers-trevor-macy-mike-flanagan-adapting-boom-studios-something-is-killing-the-children-comic-netflix-exclusive-1234979681/\">‘Doctor Sleep’ Filmmakers Tackling Hot Comic ‘Something is Killing the Children’ (Exclusive) - The Hollywood Reporter</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/tv/tv-news/something-is-killing-the-children-netflix-tv-show-1235332257/\">Hot Comic ‘Something Is Killing the Children’ Getting Series Treatment from ‘1899’ Showrunners, Netflix - The Hollywood Reporter</a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dreadcentral.com/comics-books/582354/james-tynion-iv-reveals-major-update-on-blumhouses-something-is-killing-the-children-movie-and-animated-series/\">James Tynion IV Reveals Major Update on Blumhouse’s ‘Something Is Killing the Children’ Movie and Animated Series - Dread Central</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>", "fetched_at": "2026-10-28T22:41:51+00:00"}